export anchor GridColumn:
    description:
        Sets which column lines the child starts and ends on. A single value sets the start line only; `span` sets how many columns it covers.

    identifier: gridColumn

    cssProperty:
        Corresponds to the CSS `grid-column` property.

    values:
        - `auto`
        - `<line-number>`
        - `<line-name>`
        - `span <count>`
        - `<start> / <end>`

    initial: auto

    appliesTo: Grid items (children of a grid container).

    example:
        ```emul
        \\\
        component Example:
            gridColumn: 1 / 3
        \\\
        ```
